 V2.0</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Mellanox</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ mlx_compat, mlx4_core, mlx4_en, mlx5_core ] :Mellanox T25400/MT27500/MT27520/MT25408/MT25418/MT25448/MT25408/MT26418/MT26428/MT26438/MT26448/MT25408/MT26468/MT26478/MT27600/MT27700/MT27710/ (MT27800/MT28800/MT28908/MT416842)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ ConnectX MT254xx/ConnectX-2 MT264xx/ConnectX-3 MT275xx/ConnectX-IB MT276xx/ConnectX-4 MT277xx/ (ConnectX-5 MT278xx, MT288xx/ConnectX-6 MT289xx)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Pegasus</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ pegasus ] :Pegasus/Pegasus II USB ethernet driver</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Prolific</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ plusb ] :Prolific PL-2301/2302/25A1 based</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">QLogic</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ netxen_nic ] :QLogic/NetXen NIC</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ qla3xxx ] :QLogic QLA3XXX Network driver</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ qlcnic ] :QLOGIC QLCNIC 1/10Gb Converged Ethernet</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ qlge ] :QLogic QLGE 10Gb Ethernet</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Qualcomm</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ alx ] :Qualcomm Atheros AR816x/AR817x</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Realtek</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ (r8101 ] :10/100 Realtek PCIe FE Family RTL8100E/RTL8101E/RTL8102E-GR/RTL8103E(L)/RTL8102E(L)/RTL8101E/RTL8103T/RTL8401/RTL8401P/RTL8105E/RTL8402/RTL8106E/RTL8106EUS/RTL8107E)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ r8152 ] :RTL8152/RTL8153 Based USB 2.0/3.0 Ethernet Adapter (source ] :0008-r8152.53-2.09.0.tar.bz2)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ r8168 ] :Realtek Gigabit Ethernet PCIe</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ RTL8111B/RTL8168B/RTL8111/RTL8168/RTL8111C/RTL8111CP/RTL8111D(L)/RTL8168C/RTL8111DP/RTL8111E/RTL8168E/RTL8111F/RTL8411/RTL8111G/RTL8111GUS/RTL8411B(N)/RTL8118AS/RTL8111H(S)/RTL8118/RTL8119i (source ] :0010-r8168-8.045.08.tar.bz2)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ r8169 ] :Realtek Gigabit Ethernet PCI RTL8110SC(L) (RTL8110S/RTL8110SB(L)/RTL8169SB(L)/RTL8169S(L)/RTL8169) (source ] :0008-r8169-6.025.03.tar.bz2)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ rtl8150 ] :USB RTL8150 based USB Ethernet Adapter</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Silan</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ sc92031 ] :Silan SC92031 PCI Fast Ethernet Adapter driver</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">SIS</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ sis900 ] :SiS900/7016</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ sis190 ] :SiS190/SiS191</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Solarflare</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ sfc ] :Solarflare NIC 10Gb/s</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Sundance Technology</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ (ipg ] :Sundance Technology IPG Triple-Speed Ethernet IC PLUS IP1000 NIC, Sundance Technology ST2021 based NIC, Tamarack Microelectronics TC9020/9021 based, D-Link NIC IP1000A)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Tehuti</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ tn40xx ] :Tehuti 10GbE NIC driver MV88X3120/QT2025/TLK10232/AQ2104/AQR105, ASUS XG-C100F, Buffalo LGY-PCIE-MG, D-Link DXE-810T/S, Edimax 10G, IEI Mustang-200, TN9030, TN9210, TN9310, TN9510, TN9610, TN9710P, TN9710Q (v0.3.6.16.1 from external source, might not work, at least did not on my test system, irq problems, feedback needed)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">VIA</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ via-rhine ] :VIA Rhine</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ via-velocity ] :VIA Velocity</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">VMware</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ vmxnet3 ] :VMware vmxnet3 virtual NIC</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap ] :nowrap; text-decoration ] :underline;\">[ 阵列卡》》》</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">3ware</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ 3w-xxxx ] :3ware 5/6/7/8xxx ATA-RAID support</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ 3w-9xxx ] :3ware 9xxx SATA-RAID support</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ 3w-sas ] :3ware 97xx SAS/SATA-RAID support</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Adaptec</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ aacraid ] :HBA 1000 series, Adaptec 2200S, Adaptec 2120S, Adaptec 2200S, Adaptec 3230S, Adaptec 3240S, Adaptec 2020ZCR, Adaptec 2025ZCR, Adaptec 2230S, Adaptec 2230SLP, Adaptec 2130S, Adaptec 2020SA, Adaptec 2025SA, Adaptec 2410SA, Adaptec 2610SA, Adaptec 21610SA, Adaptec 2240S, Adaptec 2810SA, Adaptec 4005, Adaptec 4000, Adaptec 4800SAS, Adaptec 4805SAS, Adaptec 2820SA, Adaptec 2620SA, Adaptec 2420SA, Adaptec 1800, Adaptec 5445, SMC AOC-USAS-S4i, Adaptec 5805, SMC AOC-USAS-S8i, Adaptec 5085, Adaptec 3405, Adaptec 3805, Adaptec 3085, Adaptec 31205, Adaptec 31605, Adaptec 51205, Adaptec 51605, SMC AOC-USAS-S4iR, SMC AOC-USAS-S8iR, Adaptec 51245, Adaptec 51645, Adaptec 52445, Adaptec 5405, SMC AOC-USAS-S8i-LP, SMC AOC-USAS-S8iR-LP, Adaptec ASR-2045, Adaptec ASR-2405, Adaptec ASR-2445, Adaptec ASR-2805, Adaptec 5405Z, Adaptec 5445Z, Adaptec 5805Z, Adaptec 5400S, Adaptec 5400S, Adaptec Themisto, Adaptec Callisto, Dell PERC 2/QC, Dell PERC 2/QC, Dell PERC 2/Si, Dell PERC 3/Si, Dell PERC 3/Di, Dell PERC 3/SiF, Dell PERC 3/DiF, Dell PERC 3/DiV, Dell PERC 3/DiL, Dell PERC 3/DiJ, Dell PERC 3/DiD, Dell PERC 3/DiB, Dell PERC 320/DC, Dell CERC 2, HP NetRAID-4M, Legend S220, Legend S230, IBM ServeRAID 7t, IBM ServeRAID 8i, IBM ServeRAID 8k/8k-l4, IBM ServeRAID 8k/8k-l8, IBM ServeRAID 8s, ICP ICP9024RO, ICP ICP9014RO, ICP ICP9047MA, ICP ICP9087MA, ICP ICP9085LI, ICP ICP5085BR, ICP ICP9067MA, ICP ICP5445SL, ICP ICP5085SL, ICP ICP5805SL, ICP ICP5045BL, ICP ICP5085BL, ICP ICP5805BL, ICP ICP5125BR, ICP ICP5165BR, ICP ICP5125SL, ICP ICP5165SL, SUN STK RAID REM, SUN STK RAID INT, SUN STK RAID EXT, SUN STK RAID EM, Adaptec RAID 6405, Adaptec RAID 6445, Adaptec RAID 6805 (external v1.2.1.56008)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ aic94xx ] :Adaptec AIC94xx SAS/SATA support</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">AMD</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ pata_amd ] :AMD 751, AMD 756, AMD 766, AMD 768, AMD 8111, AMD CS5536, nVidia nForce, nVidia nForce 2 and 3, nVidia CK804 and MCP04, nVidia MCP51, nVidia MCP55, nVidia MCP61, nVidia MCP65, nVidia MCP67, nVidia MCP73, nVidia MCP77 ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">ARECA</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ arcmsr ] :ARECA (ARC11xx/12xx/13xx/16xx) SATA/SAS RAID Host Adapter</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">BusLogic</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ buslogic ] :BusLogic SCSI</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">HighPoint</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ hptiop ] :HighPoint RocketRAID 3xxx/4xxx Controller support</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">HP</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ hpsa ] :Smart Array P212 P410 P410i P411 P812 P712m P711m ; (Gen6/7 Controllers) Smart Array P222 P420 P420i P421 P822 P220i P721 ; (Gen8 Controllers) Smart Array P430 P430i P431 P830 P830i P831 P731m P230i P530 P531 ; (Gen8.5 Controllers) Smart Array P440 P441 P840 P440ar P244br h340 h341 h340ar h344br ; (Gen9 Controllers) HP StorageWorks 1210m P1224 P1228 P1228m P1224e P1228e P1228em</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ cciss ] :old Smart Array driver up to P420, Gen7</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">IBM</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ ips ] :IBM ServeRAID support</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Intel</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ ata_piix ] :Intel IDE/PATA driver PIIX3/PIIX4/ICH0/ICH/ICh3/ICH3/C-ICH/ICh3/ICH5/6300ESB/ICH6/ICH7/ICH8M, SATA in IDE mode ] :ICH5/6300ESB/ICH6/CE3100/ICH7/NM10/631xESB/632xESB/ICH8/ICH9/ICH10/IIC</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ gdth ] :Intel/ICO RAID controller support</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ isci ] :Intel C600 Series Chipset SAS Controller</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ pata_oldpiix ] :Intel PATA old PIIX ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ pata_sch ] :Intel SCH PATA ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ pata_mpiix ] :Intel PATA MPIIX ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">JMicron</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ pata_jmicron ] :JMB361, JMB363, JMB365, JMB366, JMB368 ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">LSI</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ megaraid ] :LSI MegaRAID legacy</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ megaraid_mbox ] :LSI MegaRAID Mailbox</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ megaraid_mm ] :LSI MegaRAID Management Module</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ megaraid_sas ] :LSI MegaRAID SAS 9361-8i/9361-4i9341-8i/9341-4i/9380-8e/9380-4i4e/9270-8i9271-4i/9271-8i/9271-8iCC/9286-8e/9286CV-8e/9286CV-8eCC/9265-8i/9285-8e/9240-4i/9240-8i/9260-4i/9260CV-4i/9260-8i/9260CV-8i/9260DE-8i/9261-8i/9280-4i4e/9280-8e/9280DE-8e/9280-24i4e/9280-16i4e/9260-16i/9266-4i/9266-8i/9285CV-8e</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ mptsas ] :LSI MPT SAS1064/SAS1068/SAS1064ET/SAS1068E/SAS8208ELP/8208ELP/SAS1078</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ mpt2sas ] :LSI MPT SAS 6Gb/s Host Adapters SAS2004/SAS2008/SAS2108/SAS2116/SAS2208/SAS2308/SSS6200</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ mpt3sas ] :LSI MPT SAS 12Gb/s Host Adapters SAS3004/SAS3008/SAS3108</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Marvell</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ mvsas ] :Marvell PCIe 88SE64XX (3Gb/s) and 88SE94XX 6Gbs) SAS/SATA support, HighPoint RocketRAID 2710/2720/2721/2722/2740/2744/2760</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ mvumi ] :Marvell UMI driver</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ pata_marevell ] :88SE6101, 88SE6121, 88SE6123, 88SE6145 ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Nvidia</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ sata_nv ] :nForce MCP51, MCP55, MCP61, nForce2, nForce3, nForce4 (CK804, MCP04) ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Promise</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ sata_promise ] :PDC20318 (SATA150 TX4), PDC20319 (FastTrak S150 TX4), PDC20371 (FastTrak S150 TX2plus), PDC20378 (FastTrak 378/SATA 378), PDC20375 (SATA150 TX2plus), PDC20376 (FastTrak 376), PDC40719 [ FastTrak TX4300/TX4310 ] , PDC40519 (FastTrak TX4200), PDC20771 [ FastTrak TX2300 ] , PDC20571 (FastTrak TX2200), PDC20579 SATAII 150 IDE Controller, PDC40718 (SATA 300 TX4), PDC20518/PDC40518 (SATAII 150 TX4), PDC40775 (SATA 300 TX2plus), PDC20575 (SATAII150 TX2plus), PDC20621 [ SATA150 SX4 ] &nbsp;4 Channel IDE RAID, PDC20619 (FastTrak TX4000) ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ sata_sx4 ] :PDC20621 ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ sx8 ] :Promise SATA SX8 support</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Silicon Image</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ pata_sil680 ] :CMD/Silicon Image SiI680 PCI PATA controller ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ sata_sil:SiI311x, SiI3512 / SB300, SB300C, SB4x0 ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">Serverworks</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ [ pata_serverworks ] :OSB4/CSB5/CSB6/HT1000 PATA ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">VIA</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ pata_via ] :CX700, VT82c576, VT82c586, VT82c586A, VT82c586B, VT82c596A, VT82c596B, VT82c686, VT82c686A, VT82c686B, VT6330, VT6410, VT6415, VT6420, VT8231, VT8233, VT8233A, VT8233C, VT8235, VT8237, VT8237A, VT8237R, VT8237R Plus, VT8237S, VT8251, VT8261, VX700, VX855/875, SATA in IDE mode ] :CX700, VX700, VX800, VX900 ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0 [ sata_via ] :VX900, VT642x, VT8237 family, VT8251, VT8261 ] &nbsp;-&gt; does not load ] :Unknown symbol syno_libata_index_get (err 0)</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">VMware</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"word-break:break-all;\">[ vmw_pvscsi ] :VMware Paravirtual SCSI Controller</span></p><p><br/></p>', '1678357724', '0', '267', '', '', '1678357810', '1694745292');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('420', '2', '1', '{15}', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', '使用计划任务更新hosts', '<p>控制面板-任务计划，新增用户计划任务</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309151110302983753.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309151110485378852.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/><br/></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309151111132124404.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><!--autointro-->', '<p>控制面板-任务计划，新增用户计划任务</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309151110302983753.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309151110485378852.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/><br/></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309151111132124404.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p>任务内容如下：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">#&nbsp;三个地址&nbsp;三选一，使用#注释掉两行即可，自行测试哪一个可以获取到就用哪个\r\ncurl&nbsp;-k&nbsp;-o&nbsp;newhosts&nbsp;https://gcore.jsdelivr.net/gh/wjz304/hosts@main/hosts\r\n#curl&nbsp;-k&nbsp;-o&nbsp;newhosts&nbsp;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wjz304/hosts/main/hosts\r\n#curl&nbsp;-k&nbsp;-o&nbsp;newhosts&nbsp;https://cdn.staticaly.com/gh/wjz304/hosts/main/hosts\r\nsed&nbsp;-i&nbsp;&#39;/#&nbsp;ING&nbsp;Hosts&nbsp;Start/,/#&nbsp;ING&nbsp;Hosts&nbsp;End/d&#39;&nbsp;/etc/hosts\r\ncat&nbsp;newhosts&nbsp;&gt;&gt;&nbsp;/etc/hosts</pre><p>备用下载：</p><p><a href=\"https://ljs.fun:5245/d/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%8C%85/hosts\" _src=\"https://ljs.fun:5245/d/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%8C%85/hosts\">https://ljs.fun:5245/d/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%8C%85/hosts</a></p>', '1694747307', '0', '241', '', '', '1694747350', '1695032303');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('421', '2', '1', '', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', '威联通emby和jellyfin套件', '<p><strong>Emby：</strong></p><p>下载地址：<a href=\"https://emby.media/qnap-server.html\">Emby Server for QNAP NAS - Emby</a></p><p>备用下载：<a href=\"https://ljs.fun:5245/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%8C%85/%E9%BB%91%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E5%A8%81%E8%81%94%E9%80%9A/emby\"></a></p><!--autointro-->', '<p><strong>Emby：</strong></p><p>下载地址：<a href=\"https://emby.media/qnap-server.html\">Emby Server for QNAP NAS - Emby</a></p><p>备用下载：<a href=\"https://ljs.fun:5245/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%8C%85/%E9%BB%91%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E5%A8%81%E8%81%94%E9%80%9A/emby\">emby | 有搞头 (ljs.fun)</a></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>jellyfin：</strong></p><p>下载地址：<a href=\"https://github.com/pdulvp/jellyfin-qnap/releases\">Releases · pdulvp/jellyfin-qnap (github.com)</a></p><p>备用下载：<a href=\"https://ljs.fun:5245/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%8C%85/%E9%BB%91%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E5%A8%81%E8%81%94%E9%80%9A/jellyfin\">jellyfin | 有搞头 (ljs.fun)</a></p>', '1695002780', '0', '231', '', '', '1695002962', '1695002962');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('423', '2', '1', '', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', '编译群晖的驱动', '<p>首先要有一个linux环境，可以是群晖的dsm或ubuntu,或debian</p><p><br/></p><p>先下载<span style=\"color: #212529; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-weight: 700; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: #FFFFFF;\"></span></p><!--autointro-->', '<p>首先要有一个linux环境，可以是群晖的dsm或ubuntu,或debian</p><p><br/></p><p>先下载<span style=\"color: #212529; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-weight: 700; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: #FFFFFF;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://archive.synology.com/download/ToolChain/toolchain\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 123, 255); text-decoration-line: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline-block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-weight: 700; text-wrap: wrap;\">toolchain</a><a href=\"https://archive.synology.com/download/ToolChain/toolchain\"></a></p><p>选择版本后，下载对应平台的文件</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309181554174084823.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p>下载<a href=\"https://archive.synology.com/download/ToolChain/Synology%20NAS%20GPL%20Source\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 123, 255); text-decoration-line: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline-block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-weight: 700; text-wrap: wrap;\">Synology NAS GPL Source</a></p><p>选择版本后，先择linux-开头的对应内核版本的文件<br/></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309181555503346312.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p>root账户权限，使用winscp连接环境系统后，</p><p>安装所需软件：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">apt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;build-essential\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;libncurses-dev\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;bison\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;flex\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;libssl-dev\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;libelf-dev\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;libncurses5-dev\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;bc\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;dialog\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;dpkg-dev\r\napt-get&nbsp;install&nbsp;autocon</pre><p>创建一个工作目录，例如在home里创建syno</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">mkdir&nbsp;/home/syno</pre><p>上传toolchain文件到工作目录：</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309181557568145437.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>使用下面命令，解压文件到当前目录</p><pre class=\"brush:cpp;toolbar:false\">tar&nbsp;-xvf&nbsp;*.txz</pre><p>解压后，进入解压后的目录，上传GPL sources文件，</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309181600145555613.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>再次使用解压命令解压到当前文件夹</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">cd&nbsp;x86_64-pc-linux-gnu\r\ntar&nbsp;-xvf&nbsp;*.txz</pre><p>进入解压后的目录，不同内核版本目录不同</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">cd&nbsp;linux-4.4.x</pre><p><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309181602074631841.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></span></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\">复制平台对应的配置文件到此目录，</span></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\">4.4内核的配置文件在synoconfigs目录内</span></p><p>5.1内核的配置文件在synology/synoconfigs</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309251012099418848.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">cp&nbsp;synoconfigs/geminilake&nbsp;.config</pre><p>菜单化修改配置文件</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">make&nbsp;menuconfig</pre><p>找到需要编译的驱动，按空格键切换为&lt;M&gt;,</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309121641316414100.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>保存后，创建环境，及执行清理文件，编译工作</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">#&nbsp;平台，x86或arm64\r\nexport&nbsp;ARCH=x86\r\n#&nbsp;工具路径，在上一级的bin目录\r\nexport&nbsp;CROSS_COMPILE=[前面的路径补全]/bin/x86_64-pc-linux-gnu-\r\n#&nbsp;清理\r\nmake&nbsp;clean\r\n#&nbsp;执行编译,j值为编译工作调用核心数\r\nmake&nbsp;modules&nbsp;-j4</pre><p>如只需编译指定类型的驱动可使用M参数指定目录</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">make&nbsp;modules&nbsp;M=./drivers/hwmon&nbsp;-j4</pre><p>编译后的文件在路径drivers下面对应的分类里。</p><p>如螃蟹网卡驱动在这里：<br/></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309251013555746461.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p><strong>关于编译时候报错：</strong></p><pre class=\"brush:cpp;toolbar:false\">subcmd-util.h:&nbsp;In&nbsp;function&nbsp;‘xrealloc’:\r\nsubcmd-util.h:58:31:&nbsp;error:&nbsp;pointer&nbsp;‘ptr’&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;used&nbsp;after&nbsp;‘realloc’&nbsp;[-Werror=use-after-free]\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;58&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(ptr,&nbsp;1);\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\nsubcmd-util.h:52:21:&nbsp;note:&nbsp;call&nbsp;to&nbsp;‘realloc’&nbsp;here\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;52&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;void&nbsp;*ret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(ptr,&nbsp;size);\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\ncc1:&nbsp;all&nbsp;warnings&nbsp;being&nbsp;treated&nbsp;as&nbsp;errors</pre><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\">代码原因</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\">旧版本 Linux 的 linux-5.10.x/tools/lib/subcmd/subcmd-util.h 里写法有点问题，realloc 后还用 ptr，新编译器严格检查时会触发警告。</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\">解决办法</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\">编辑出错的文件：</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\">tools/lib/subcmd/subcmd-util.h</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\">找到这一段，大概在L50：</span></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\"></span></p><pre class=\"brush:cpp;toolbar:false\">static&nbsp;inline&nbsp;void&nbsp;*xrealloc(void&nbsp;*ptr,&nbsp;size_t&nbsp;size)\r\n{\r\nvoid&nbsp;*ret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(ptr,&nbsp;size);\r\nif&nbsp;(!ret&nbsp;&amp;&amp;&nbsp;!size)\r\nret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(ptr,&nbsp;1);\r\nif&nbsp;(!ret)&nbsp;{\r\nret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(ptr,&nbsp;size);\r\nif&nbsp;(!ret&nbsp;&amp;&amp;&nbsp;!size)\r\nret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(ptr,&nbsp;1);\r\nif&nbsp;(!ret)\r\ndie(&quot;Out&nbsp;of&nbsp;memory,&nbsp;realloc&nbsp;failed&quot;);\r\n}\r\nreturn&nbsp;ret;\r\n}</pre><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\">改为：</span></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\"></span></p><pre class=\"brush:cpp;toolbar:false\">static&nbsp;inline&nbsp;void&nbsp;*xrealloc(void&nbsp;*ptr,&nbsp;size_t&nbsp;size)\r\n{\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;void&nbsp;*ret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(ptr,&nbsp;size);\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if&nbsp;(!ret&nbsp;&amp;&amp;&nbsp;!size)\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(NULL,&nbsp;1);\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if&nbsp;(!ret)&nbsp;{\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(NULL,&nbsp;size);\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if&nbsp;(!ret&nbsp;&amp;&amp;&nbsp;!size)\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ret&nbsp;=&nbsp;realloc(NULL,&nbsp;1);\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if&nbsp;(!ret)\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;die(&quot;Out&nbsp;of&nbsp;memory,&nbsp;realloc&nbsp;failed&quot;);\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return&nbsp;ret;\r\n}</pre><p><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\"></span><br/></p><p><span style=\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\">再重新编译即可</span></p><p><br/></p>', '1695023405', '0', '342', '', '', '1695024678', '1759225247');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('425', '2', '1', '', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', 'Office无法启动，提示“很抱歉,出现错误,Word不能启动。(2)”', '<p>此问题出现在重装了office，而第一次卸载后未重启系统的情况，</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309211843473178366.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>解决办法：</p><p>Ctrl+R, 运行 regedit，</p><p>定位到：</p><p><span style=\"color: #444444; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: #FFFFFF;\"></span></p><!--autointro-->', '<p>此问题出现在重装了office，而第一次卸载后未重启系统的情况，</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309211843473178366.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>解决办法：</p><p>Ctrl+R, 运行 regedit，</p><p>定位到：</p><p><span style=\"color: #444444; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: #FFFFFF;\">HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Office，把Office这个项删了就行了</span></p>', '1695292943', '0', '243', '', '', '1695293090', '1695293090');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('426', '2', '1', '', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', 'linux查询系统安装时间', '<p>以下办法不一定都管用，但至少有一种管用。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>1. 查看 /var/log/installer/syslog 文件</strong></p><p>在许多 Linux 发行版中，安装过程会生成一个日志文件，记录了系统安装的详细信息，包括安装日期和时间。这个日志文件通常位于 /var/log/installer/syslog。可以使用以下命令查看该文件的内容：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">cat&nbsp;/var/log/installer/syslog</pre><!--autointro-->', '<p>以下办法不一定都管用，但至少有一种管用。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>1. 查看 /var/log/installer/syslog 文件</strong></p><p>在许多 Linux 发行版中，安装过程会生成一个日志文件，记录了系统安装的详细信息，包括安装日期和时间。这个日志文件通常位于 /var/log/installer/syslog。可以使用以下命令查看该文件的内容：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">cat&nbsp;/var/log/installer/syslog</pre><p>打开日志文件后，可以搜索关键字 “installation started”，找到相应的条目以获取安装日期和时间的记录。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>2. 使用命令查找安装日期</strong></p><p>如果系统中没有 /var/log/installer/syslog 文件，可以使用命令来查找安装日期和时间。以下是一些常用的命令：</p><p><br/></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2.1. 使用 ls 命令查看根目录下的文件</p><p>安装过程中，根目录下的一些重要文件通常具有与安装日期相关的时间戳。可以使用 ls 命令来列出根目录下的文件，并查找其中具有较早时间戳的文件。以下是查找命令的示例：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">ls&nbsp;-lt&nbsp;--time=creation&nbsp;/</pre><p>这将按照文件的创建时间排序，并显示根目录下的文件列表。可以通过查找列表中的最早创建的文件来确定安装日期和时间。</p><p><br/></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2.2. 使用 tune2fs 命令查看文件系统创建时间</p><p>文件系统的创建时间通常与操作系统的安装时间相对应。可以使用 tune2fs 命令来查看文件系统的创建时间。以下是查找命令的示例：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">sudo&nbsp;tune2fs&nbsp;-l&nbsp;/dev/sda1&nbsp;|&nbsp;grep&nbsp;&quot;Filesystem&nbsp;created&quot;</pre><p>将 /dev/sda1 替换为实际的根文件系统设备。执行命令后，将显示文件系统的创建时间，即为操作系统的安装日期和时间。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>3. 使用历史命令查找安装日期</strong></p><p>在命令行中，你可以使用 history 命令查看之前执行的命令历史记录。这可能会包含有关操作系统安装的相关信息。以下是查找历史命令的示例：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">history&nbsp;|&nbsp;grep&nbsp;&quot;install&quot;&nbsp;|&nbsp;grep&nbsp;&quot;linux&quot;</pre><p>这个命令将过滤出包含 “install” 和 “linux” 关键字的历史命令。通过检查这些命令，你可能会找到与操作系统安装相关的记录，其中包含安装日期和时间的信息。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>4. 查看 /var/log/dpkg.log 文件</strong></p><p>在使用基于 Debian 的 Linux 发行版时，可以查看 /var/log/dpkg.log 文件来获取安装日期和时间的记录。该文件记录了系统上安装、升级和删除软件包的详细信息。可以使用以下命令查看该文件的内容：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">cat&nbsp;/var/log/dpkg.log</pre><p>打开日志文件后，可以搜索关键字 “installed”，找到相应的条目以获取软件包的安装日期和时间。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>5. 检查 /proc 文件系统</strong></p><p>在 Linux 中，/proc 文件系统提供了有关运行中系统的各种信息。可以通过读取 /proc/1/status 文件来获取系统的启动时间。以下是查找命令的示例：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">cat&nbsp;/proc/1/status&nbsp;|&nbsp;grep&nbsp;&quot;btime&quot;</pre><p>命令的输出将显示系统的启动时间，即为操作系统的安装日期和时间。</p><p><br/></p>', '1695386807', '0', '180', '', '', '1695386968', '1696833599');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('437', '2', '1', '', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', '查询群晖的系统版本信息', '<p>使用以下命令查询</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">cat&nbsp;/etc.defaults/VERSION</pre><p>得到结果如下：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">majorversion=&quot;6&quot;\r\nminorversion=&quot;2&quot;\r\nproductversion=&quot;6.2.3&quot;\r\nbuildphase=&quot;GM&quot;\r\nbuildnumber=&quot;25426&quot;\r\nsmallfixnumber=&quot;2&quot;\r\nbuilddate=&quot;2020/07/08&quot;\r\nbuildtime=&quot;06:24:39&quot;</pre><!--autointro-->', '<p>使用以下命令查询</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">cat&nbsp;/etc.defaults/VERSION</pre><p>得到结果如下：</p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false\">majorversion=&quot;6&quot;\r\nminorversion=&quot;2&quot;\r\nproductversion=&quot;6.2.3&quot;\r\nbuildphase=&quot;GM&quot;\r\nbuildnumber=&quot;25426&quot;\r\nsmallfixnumber=&quot;2&quot;\r\nbuilddate=&quot;2020/07/08&quot;\r\nbuildtime=&quot;06:24:39&quot;</pre><p><br/></p>', '1696833699', '0', '209', '', '', '1696833776', '1696833776');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('438', '2', '1', '', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', '群晖批量创建账户', '<p>群晖可以通过导入格式化的txt文件，批量创建用户。</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/10/202310101717412993784.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>导入格式：</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/10/202310101718264554661.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><!--autointro-->', '<p>群晖可以通过导入格式化的txt文件，批量创建用户。</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/10/202310101717412993784.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>导入格式：</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/10/202310101718264554661.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>可以在excel中先录入信息，在复制到txt里即可，</p><p>每列顺序按上传文件窗口中每栏的顺序，缺省的内容就保留这一列空着，主要需要设置<strong>名称，密码，群组名称，</strong>空间配额缺省即默认<strong>无限制</strong>（空间配额可以在群组里指定）<strong>，</strong>状态缺省默认<strong>正常</strong></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/10/202310101719412833380.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/10/202310101720222859558.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>分隔符默认Tab即可。<br/></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/10/202310101721256753376.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/>、</p><p>确认操作，即可批量生成用户。<br/></p>', '1696929388', '0', '209', '', '', '1696930096', '1696930316');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('427', '2', '1', '', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', '群晖audio station歌词插件', '<p>如果音乐文件没有内嵌歌词的话，使用audio station或ds audio 播放音乐可能会没有歌词显示，添加以下插件即可。</p><p style=\"line-height: 16px;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;\" src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/plugin/Neditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\"/></p><!--autointro-->', '<p>如果音乐文件没有内嵌歌词的话，使用audio station或ds audio 播放音乐可能会没有歌词显示，添加以下插件即可。</p><p style=\"line-height: 16px;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;\" src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/plugin/Neditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\"/><a style=\"font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;\" href=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231054556904434.rar\" title=\"歌词插件.rar\">歌词插件.rar</a></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231055145559759.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>解压后，不需要上传群晖，在audio station中直接添加即可，会从本地上传。</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231056299743798.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>选择*.aum文件逐个添加即可</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231057045524454.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p>重新播放音乐，应该就可以正常显示歌词了</p>', '1695437526', '0', '297', '', '', '1695437864', '1695437864');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('428', '2', '1', '', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', '群晖webstation创建网站', '<ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><li><p>安装webstation套件</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231922531663529.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>安装php，db10，phpMyAdmin 等套件，如创建纯网页网站，不需要数据库的，可以跳过有关db10和phpMyAdmin相关内容。</p></li></ol><!--autointro-->', '<ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><li><p>安装webstation套件</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231922531663529.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>安装php，db10，phpMyAdmin 等套件，如创建纯网页网站，不需要数据库的，可以跳过有关db10和phpMyAdmin相关内容。</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231931355246608.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>打开db10，按指引设置账户和密码，端口默认即可。</p></li><li><p>内网打开phpmyadmin, 用db10的账户，密码登录，然后新增一个数据库</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231935011688269.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/><br/></p></li><li><p>解压网站程序文件到自定义目录</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231923273131383.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>打开webstation, 选择<strong>网页服务</strong>，新增一项，选择<strong>本机脚本语言网站</strong>，选择<strong>php</strong>版本，<strong>右侧默认</strong></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231924098257468.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>设置<strong>网站名称</strong>，选择<strong>程序目录</strong></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231925405542238.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>确定</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231925583829988.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/><br/></p></li><li><p>到<strong>网络门户</strong>，新增一项，</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231926188367838.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>选择<strong>网页服务门户</strong></p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231926369401477.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>选择刚才创建的<strong>服务</strong>，门户类型选择<strong>基于端口</strong>，<strong>按需勾选http/https</strong>，并填入<strong>端口号</strong>。</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231927323371914.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>浏览器访问<strong>ip:端口</strong>，即可按程序指引安装网站</p><p><img src=\"{#ZC_BLOG_HOST#}zb_users/upload/2023/09/202309231929084835054.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p></li><li><p>需要输入数据库的网站，在数据库选项里填写在phpmyAdmin里创建的数据库名称，并填写数据库的登录账号，密码。<br/></p></li></ol>', '1695468127', '0', '199', '', '', '1695468698', '1695469063');
INSERT INTO `zbp_post` (`log_ID`, `log_CateID`, `log_AuthorID`, `log_Tag`, `log_Status`, `log_Type`, `log_Alias`, `log_IsTop`, `log_IsLock`, `log_Title`, `log_Intro`, `log_Content`, `log_PostTime`, `log_CommNums`, `log_ViewNums`, `log_Template`, `log_Meta`, `log_CreateTime`, `log_UpdateTime`) VALUES ('429', '2', '1', '', '0', '0', '', '0', '0', 'Wireguard 服务器端建立在威联通QVPN上', '<p id=\"da03\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">转载自：<a href=\"https://medium.com/@mways/wireguard-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E7%AB%AF%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E5%9C%A8%E5%A8%81%E8%81%94%E9%80%9Aqvpn%E4%B8%8A-5e2674238639\">Wireguard 服务器端建立在威联通QVPN上 - 网络小白折腾笔记 - Medium</a></p><!--autointro-->', '<p id=\"da03\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">转载自：<a href=\"https://medium.com/@mways/wireguard-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E7%AB%AF%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E5%9C%A8%E5%A8%81%E8%81%94%E9%80%9Aqvpn%E4%B8%8A-5e2674238639\">Wireguard 服务器端建立在威联通QVPN上 - 网络小白折腾笔记 - Medium</a></p><p id=\"da03\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">我的第三个wireguard服务器，测试也成功了。</p><p id=\"1d29\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">直接建立在威联通的QVPN上。qnap上无需做端口转发。</p><p id=\"dda4\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">但是需要设置好威联通qufirewall防火墙，否则只能访问网关。</p><p id=\"9822\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">我的主路由：华硕ac86u 安装了merlinclash科学上网插件</p><p id=\"9d65\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">华硕主路由器：WAN-NAT类型 需要修改成Full Cone</p><p id=\"4a17\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">华硕主路由端口：51821 （也是qvpn的endpoint监听端口）</p><p id=\"8844\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">主路由需要针对该端口做端口转发。</p><p><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/format:webp/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/format:webp/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/format:webp/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/format:webp/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/format:webp/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1168/format:webp/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 1168w\" sizes=\"(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 584px\" type=\"image/webp\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"/><source data-testid=\"og\" srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1168/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png 1168w\" sizes=\"(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 584px\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"loadingclass\" width=\"584\" height=\"399\" loading=\"eager\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:584/1*5AeZsjvJ4g0utadbht2uFA.png\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: middle; width: 584px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;\"/></picture></div></figure></p><p id=\"5de5\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">QVPN的wireguard服务器 不同客户端peer可以也用相同的配置信息。当最好不要重复。</p><p><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/format:webp/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/format:webp/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/format:webp/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/format:webp/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/format:webp/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1076/format:webp/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 1076w\" sizes=\"(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 538px\" type=\"image/webp\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"/><source data-testid=\"og\" srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1076/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png 1076w\" sizes=\"(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 538px\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"loadingclass\" width=\"538\" height=\"324\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:538/1*8tAS0wiRp_ZdMUmzdRzqXA.png\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: middle; width: 538px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;\"/></picture></div></figure></p><p id=\"abb1\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">peer添加步骤：</p><p id=\"b49c\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">打开wireguard iphone客户端（mac也行），复制客户端公钥到qvpn新增peer栏目的公钥。具体对应关系图如下：</p><p><figure><div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/format:webp/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/format:webp/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/format:webp/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/format:webp/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/format:webp/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" type=\"image/webp\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"/><source data-testid=\"og\" srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"loadingclass\" width=\"700\" height=\"295\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:700/1*E2T2CiEZn-v65GYMWHLorA.png\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: middle; width: 680px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;\"/></picture></div></div></figure></p><p id=\"3782\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">内网的ip地址，只要后面带/24这种区间说明，那么实际上写哪个数字都是可以的。比如mac和iphone都可以写198.18.7.2/24(而不用一个198.18.7.2/24，另外一个198.18.7.3/24）</p><p><figure><div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/1*Px1YJ